msgid "vs.intro.uenroll"
msgstr "uEnroll is a fast, open-source schedule generator for uOttawa, and a great one. uoPlan does the same conflict-free generation, then goes further: it maps your degree requirements, imports your transcript, and layers in grades and professor ratings so you plan your whole program, not just next term."

msgid "vs.intro.uo-grades"
msgstr "UO Grades is the go-to for deep uOttawa grade history and official evaluations. uoPlan surfaces the same kind of grade and professor data, but wraps it in a full planner that maps your degree and builds conflict-free schedules around it."

msgid "vs.intro.uschedule"
msgstr "uSchedule generates scored timetables and shows professor ratings inline. uoPlan matches the ratings-aware scheduling and adds degree planning, transcript import, grade trends, and the professor network, all with no ads and fully open source."

